  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, the demon hunter gains a bonus equal to her Charisma bonus (if any) on Will saving throws. If she gains the <a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats\">Ki Awakened feat</a>, she can use her Charisma score in place of her Wisdom score to determine ki points gained and to determine how long she can maintain her ki focus. Her Charisma score determines the maximum number of ki points she can invest into a chakra as well as her ability to replenish ki. Likewise, her Charisma score, not Wisdom, determines if she meets any prerequisites for any ki or chakra feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/demon-hunter#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
